  "label": "Religious Language in Juxtaposition with Mundane Context",
  "description": "The meme uses sacred religious language ('sins', 'forgiven', 'Father') in a context that is mundane and childish (drooling child). This juxtaposition is the core of the humor and requires understanding of religious discourse and its contrast with everyday life to be appreciated. It is a form of satire that relies on the incongruity between the two.",
